
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>SADI Digital Learning Hub</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #063b24;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
}

header {
    background: #022817;
    padding: 25px 10px;
}

header h1 {
    color: #00ff80;
    font-size: 38px;
    margin: 5px;
}

header p {
    color: gold;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

nav {
    background: #105c39;
    padding: 15px;
}

nav a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin: 8px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.hero {
    padding: 55px 15px;
    background: linear-gradient(#063b24, #087044);
}

.hero h2 {
    color: gold;
    font-size: 30px;
}

.hero button {
    background: gold;
    color: #063b24;
    padding: 14px 25px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
}

.section {
    background: #105c39;
    margin: 22px;
    padding: 25px;
    border-radius: 15px;
}

.section h2 {
    color: #00ff80;
}

.skills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
}

.skill {
    background: #022817;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    flex: 1 1 130px;
}

.registration {
    background: white;
    color: #063b24;
    margin: 22px;
    padding: 25px;
    border-radius: 15px;
}

.registration input,
.registration select {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 13px;
    margin: 13px 0;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    border-radius: 8px;
}

.registration button {
    background: #008f4c;
    color: white;
    padding: 14px 25px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
}

footer {
    background: #022817;
    padding: 25px;
    margin-top: 30px;
    color: white;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>⚡ SADI</h1>
    <p>DIGITAL LEARNING HUB</p>
    <small>Technology • Creativity • Innovation</small>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#programs">Programs</a>
    <a href="#register">Register</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
    <h2>WELCOME TO SADI!</h2>

    <p>
        Empowering young minds through
        technology and digital skills.
    </p>

    <a href="#register">
        <button>GET STARTED</button>
    </a>
</section>

<section class="section" id="about">
    <h2>ABOUT SADI</h2>

    <p>
        SADI is a digital learning project
        focused on helping young people
        discover technology, develop skills
        and explore their creativity.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="section" id="programs">
    <h2>OUR DIGITAL PROGRAMS</h2>

    <div class="skills">
        <div class="skill">
            <h3>💻</h3>
            <p>Computer Science</p>
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
            <h3>🌐</h3>
            <p>Web Development</p>
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
            <h3>⌨️</h3>
            <p>Coding & Programming</p>
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
            <h3>🚀</h3>
            <p>Digital Skills</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <h2>OUR VISION</h2>

    <p>
        To inspire a generation of creative,
        skilled and innovative young people
        who can use technology to solve problems.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="registration" id="register">
    <h2>STUDENT REGISTRATION</h2>

    <p>Join our digital learning community!</p>

    <form onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Thank you for your interest in SADI! This is a demonstration form.');">

        <input type="text"
        placeholder="Full Name" required>

        <input type="number"
        placeholder="Age" min="1" max="100" required>

        <input type="email"
        placeholder="Email Address" required>

        <select required>
            <option value="">Select Your Course</option>
            <option>Computer Science</option>
            <option>Web Development</option>
            <option>Programming</option>
            <option>Digital Skills</option>
        </select>

        <button type="submit">REGISTER NOW</button>

    </form>
</section>

<footer>
    <h3>SADI DIGITAL LEARNING HUB</h3>

    <p>Learning Today. Creating Tomorrow.</p>

    <p>Student Demonstration Project</p>

    <p>Created with HTML, CSS and JavaScript.</p>

    <small>© 2026 SADI Demo Project</small>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
